1244	1324	1239	1240	Father Christopher	22	" Call upon God . . . . Lomonosov set off with the fishermen in the same way , and he became a man famous all over Europe . Learning in conjunction with faith brings forth fruit pleasing to God . What are the words of the prayer ? For the glory of our Maker , for the comfort of our parents , for the benefit of our Church and our country . . . . Yes , indeed ! "
1325	1336	1338	1338	Kuzmitchov	21	" The benefit is not the same in all cases , "
1345	1358	1338	1338	Kuzmitchov	21	" some will study twenty years and get no sense from it . "
1359	1364	1193	1193	Yegorushka	25	" That does happen . "
1365	1465	1239	1240	Father Christopher	22	" Learning is a benefit to some , but others only muddle their brains . My sister is a woman who does not understand ; she is set upon refinement , and wants to turn Yegorka into a learned man , and she does not understand that with my business I could settle Yegorka happily for the rest of his life . I tell you this , that if everyone were to go in for being learned and refined there would be no one to sow the corn and do the trading ; they would all die of hunger . "
