8891	8978	9029	9030	a woman	292	" What a happy day for me ! Oh , what am I to do now ? Ivan Ivanitch ! Father Christopher ! What a pretty little gentleman sitting on the box , God strike me dead ! Oh , my goodness ! why am I standing here instead of asking the visitors indoors ? Please walk in , I humbly beg you . . . . You are kindly welcome ! Give me all your things . . . . Oh , my goodness me ! "
9017	9022	9029	9030	a woman	292	" Solomon ! Solomon ! "
9023	9028	9151	9152	Moisey Moisevitch	48	" Solomon ! Solomon ! "
