10197	10219	10422	10422	he	48	" Solomon , why did you not come to our fair at N. this summer , and act some Jewish scenes ? "
10409	10421	10471	10471	he	48	" I wish you a good appetite ! Tea and sugar ! "
10431	10470	10471	10471	he	48	" I hope you will enjoy it . Such rare guests , such rare ones ; it is years since I last saw Father Christopher . And will no one tell me who is this nice little gentleman ? "
10479	10491	10471	10471	he	48	" He is the son of my sister , Olga Ivanovna , "
10495	10502	10518	10518	his	48	" And where is he going ? "
