10555	10608	10521	10522	Moisey Moisevitch	48	" That 's a fine thing . You will come back from the high school such a gentleman that we shall all take off our hats to you . You will be wealthy and wise and so grand that your mamma will be delighted . Oh , that 's a fine thing ! "
10628	10690	10710	10711	Father Christopher	22	" You must excuse me , Father Christopher , but I am thinking of writing to the bishop to tell him you are robbing the merchants of their living . I shall take a sheet of stamped paper and write that I suppose Father Christopher is short of pence , as he has taken up with trade and begun selling wool . "
10691	10708	10710	10711	Father Christopher	22	" H'm , yes . . . it 's a queer notion in my old age , "
10717	10757	10521	10522	Moisey Moisevitch	48	" I have turned from priest to merchant , brother . I ought to be at home now saying my prayers , instead of galloping about the country like a Pharaoh in his chariot . . . . Vanity ! "
