13631	13711	13783	13784	Father Christopher	22	" Though Varlamov is a Russian , he is at heart a scabby Jew ; money and gain are all he lives for , but I threw my money in the stove ! I do n't want money , or land , or sheep , and there is no need for people to be afraid of me and to take off their hats when I pass . So I am wiser than your Varlamov and more like a man ! "
